---
description: Note contract enforcement for vault markdown
globs: **/*.md
alwaysApply: false
---

Quick contract for any markdown you touch (full spec: CLAUDE.md §5–§6):

- Every content note needs YAML frontmatter with at least `type` and `created`; notes inside
  a session folder (except the hub) also need `session:`. Allowed values:
  `90-meta/taxonomy.md`. Paths under `_template/` and `90-meta/templates/` are exempt —
  leave their `{{placeholders}}` intact.
- NEVER edit between `<!-- weave:start -->` and `<!-- weave:end -->`. That block is
  generated; to change it, edit `related:` frontmatter and tell the user to run `/weave`.
- Never modify files in `20-capture/` after creation; distill state lives in
  `_distill-log.md` only.
- Filenames: kebab-case. One idea per file. Internal links are wikilinks; links written by
  tooling are vault-absolute with an alias (`[[30-sessions/…/40-synthesis|Synthesis]]`).
- Never delete a note — set `status: parked`. Never rename without fixing inbound links.
